@startuml BrewLite-Deployment
title BrewLite – Sơ đồ triển khai mục tiêu

node "Trình duyệt khách hàng" as Browser {
  [Next.js App] as WebApp
}

node "Frontend Host\n(Vercel / static host)" as FE {
  [Next.js build\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL] as FEApp
}

node "Backend Host\n(Container / VM, chạy dài)" as BE {
  [NestJS API\n/api/v1] as API
  [Cron mỗi phút\nhủy đơn quá hạn] as Cron
  [Prisma Client] as Prisma
}

database "PostgreSQL managed\n(SSL + backup)" as DB

cloud "ZaloPay Sandbox" as ZLP {
  [Create / Query / Cancel API] as ZLPAPI
  [Callback HTTPS] as ZLPCB
}

cloud "GitHub" as GH {
  [Repository] as Repo
  [GitHub Actions\nCI trên main] as CI
}

Browser --> FEApp : HTTPS
FEApp --> API : HTTPS JSON + JWT
API --> Prisma
Prisma --> DB : TCP 5432 / SSL
API --> ZLPAPI : HTTPS form-urlencoded\nHMAC-SHA256
ZLPCB --> API : POST /payments/zalopay/callback\n(verify MAC key2)
Cron --> DB

Repo --> CI : push / pull_request (main)
CI --> Repo : build + test + artifact

note right of BE
  Không dùng serverless thuần vì @Cron.
  Rollback = deploy lại image tag trước.
end note

note bottom of DB
  Migration: prisma migrate deploy (forward-only).
  Backup trước mỗi lần migration production.
end note

@enduml
